WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,340
Boss, is there something wrong with the guest?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,900
I wonder if what the boss said still counts?

3
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,210
How many things can be done to provide goods in large quantities

4
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,810
I'll leave early tomorrow morning

5
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,780
I will also rush back to pick up the goods statically.

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,520
I hope the boss can prepare enough goods

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,480
It’s okay to waste both parties’ time.

8
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:23,200
I still don’t know how to call the boss. My surname is Xia.

9
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,560
Just call me Boss Xia

10
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,570
Okay, Boss Xia, my name is Su Mei.

11
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:33,960
brocade clothes for sale

12
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,530
Just give me some light, just stand there and don't move.

13
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:41,300
This frame looks good, take it away

14
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,300
This forehead and foot lamp is also good. Take it away.

15
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,900
Also take away this walnut stone and wood single bed.
